# Docs-only public repository.
#
# Only the README and docs/ are published to GitHub. The installer, slash
# commands, managed-credits service, release tooling and build files stay on the
# release machine and reach users through npm + the private skill tarball.
#
# Publish with `npm publish` from the working tree: npm reads `files` from
# package.json, not Git, so the code does not need to be committed.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/docs/
!/docs/**
